1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:11,840
Defeating the Pirate

2
00:00:12,680 --> 00:00:21,480
Doctor Ly visits patient at innkeeper's house.

3
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:29,260
In inn there is a pirate looking very fierce.

4
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:38,970
He drinks alcohol and sings wild songs.

5
00:00:39,570 --> 00:00:48,770
He orders everyone to be silent. Everyone quiets down.

6
00:00:48,930 --> 00:01:00,020
Only Doctor Ly calmly explains how to treat illness to innkeeper.

7
00:01:00,660 --> 00:01:08,260
Pirate shouts, orders Doctor Ly to be silent.

8
00:01:08,910 --> 00:01:15,400
He also draws dagger to stab Doctor Ly.

9
00:01:15,400 --> 00:01:27,930
But Doctor Ly still kindly reminds him to put dagger away and not drink alcohol.

10
00:01:27,930 --> 00:01:41,880
Finally, before Doctor Ly's courage, pirate hangs head, dejectedly sits down.

11
00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:49,950
From that night, pirate is silent as rice grain.

